From 58695c636580045ee553ec0226423e3d16eb6fa7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneup03 <oneup03@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:29:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Optional: no trace hooks in simple leaf functions
 (trace_skip_simple_leaves)

With trace_mode, a function that makes no call (jal, jalr, a linking
branch), jumps nowhere outside itself, never branches backwards and has
no jump table or hook gets no TRACE_ENTRY or TRACE_RETURN: it runs a
bounded few instructions, and a hook that checks for preemption would be
much of its code. [input]'s trace_skip_simple_leaves, off by default.
Banjo's 3DS build leaves 1,736 of its 8,352 functions without hooks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
